1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,785
大多数工厂，是把东西装起来。
Most factories put things together.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,871
你身体里这一座，专门拆。
The one inside you takes them apart.

3
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,630
第一站，粉碎机。
It starts at the crushers.

4
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:19,254
酸液滚筒把它搅成一团糊，
An acid drum churns it all to paste,

5
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:23,823
看门人一次只放出去一勺。
and a gatekeeper lets it out, a spoonful at a time.

6
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:28,248
到了分拣线，三明治被拆开：
On the sorting line, the sandwich comes apart:

7
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:32,090
面包变成糖，火腿变成氨基酸，
bread into sugar, ham into amino acids,

8
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:34,658
奶酪变成脂肪酸。
cheese into fatty acids.

9
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:39,847
肝把糖码上货架，然后等着。
The liver shelves the sugar, and it waits.

10
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,379
6 个小时以后：公交车来了。
6 hours later: the bus.

11
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:47,532
顺着动脉，送进一个个小熔炉。
Down the arteries, into tiny furnaces.

12
00:00:47,550 --> 00:00:51,817
拆开了的午饭，变成你奔跑的力气。
Taken apart, lunch becomes the strength to run.

